<title>JAPAN: Futata -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Futata -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.37		vs	   10.90</p>
<p> Operating	  155    million    vs	  128    million</p>
<p> Current	    183    million    vs	  112    million</p>
<p> Net		  121    million    vs	   70    million</p>
